# Local rules

Part of the [[README]]. This vault's own rules, on top of [[strict-rules]]. Every agent reads this page right after [[strict-rules]]. The kit never changes `Agents/local/`, so a rule [[= owner =]] adds lives here, not in a kit page ([[README#Kit-managed pages]]).

- **IDs:** L1, L2, and so on; never reused or renumbered.
- **Precedence:** a local rule beats a kit heuristic and any kit manual page, never an invariant or module rule ([[README#Precedence]]).
- **Adding one:** [[= owner =]] says "from now on…"; [[role-vault-admin]] writes it here with a dated line in [[changelog]] (Steps: a rule change).
- **Format:** `- **L1. <rule, one sentence>.** <why or scope, optional>`

